  "properties": {
    "title": "Tile-based GIS",
    "description": "This short talk is about applying the concept of tiles to store geospatial information in a database and use it efficiently. We'll explore the scenarios where this method is beneficial and demonstrate how to implement it using PostgreSQL/PostGIS and the ST_AsMV function for data storage, retrieval, and visualization.",
